  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Toulouse Business School (TBS) is one of France’s leading business schools, established in 1903. They offer a wide range of programmes, from undergraduate to executive education, covering everything from business administration and finance to marketing and management. TBS is consistently ranked among the best in France, and they hold impressive accreditations like AACSB, EQUIS, and AMBA.</p><p>What’s more, TBS has a strong global network of partner universities and offers exciting opportunities for double degrees and student exchange programmes, giving you the chance to gain international exposure.</p><p>When it comes to the application, you won’t need to stress about a Statement of Purpose (SOP) or Letters of Recommendation (LOR) since they’re optional. Only the academic transcripts are a must. Plus, for students from India and Nigeria, TBS has made things easier by completely waiving the IELTS requirement.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Your student life at TBS will be inclusive and supportive. The Students’ Union hosts a rich mix of clubs and societies. You’ll have a mix of academic, professional, and social activities, supported by a vibrant community of students from all over the world.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Toulouse Business School partners with Kley, The Social Hub, Studapart, Nexity and more accommodation providers to offer you student housing close to the campus.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The TBS library is equipped with everything you need for studying, including group work rooms with video conferencing and interactive whiteboards.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>TBS has some great research and learning labs, like the Social &amp; Innovation Marketing Lab. There's also the AI &amp; Business Analytics Centre of Excellence, focused on research and education in AI and data analytics.&nbsp;</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
